{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Classic Lamp is a piece of furniture that provides light at night. It can rotate into daily stock at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]," for 1,000g or the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for between 250–2,500g. It can also be purchased at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," from ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],"'s ",["l","沙漠节#Villager Shops","shop"]," for 40 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s."]],["p",["It's also available from the ",["l","家具目录","Furniture Catalogue"]," for 0g."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.0","1.0"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Can now be purchased from ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],"."]]]]]]]}